OL,3,GNEWSADig suggests answers to Roman
OL,4,Afield mystery
OL,5,
OL,6,FArchaeologists believe they have solved
OL,7,Fan early Roman farming mystery.
OL,9,FThe team at Cotswold Archaeology were
OL,10,Fexcavating a claggy site at Littleport,
OL,11,FCambridgeshire, in 2022 when they came
OL,12,Facross shallow cultivation trenches.
OL,14,FExperts previously suggested similar
OL,15,Fparallel trenches might have been
OL,16,Fbedding channels for vegetables - or
OL,17,Feven vineyards.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
